14	// CUDA sm_90 (Hopper) primitives — shared across all 11 launch_*.cu files.
15	//
16	// This header consolidates vendor-specific intrinsics that the optimizer
17	// launch files use repeatedly: warp/block/cluster reductions, vec4 helpers,
18	// non-temporal load/store, stochastic rounding, RoPE pair rotation, fused
19	// element ingestion, and grid-stride loop helpers.
20	//
21	// Algorithm-neutral. Per-element optimizer math lives in csrc/algorithms/.
22	// Per-backend launch glue (kernel definitions + host launchers) lives in
23	// the 11 csrc/backends/cuda/sm_90/launch_<optimizer>.cu files which include
24	// both this header and the relevant algorithm header.
